# W27, guest b (k5): plays in a's instance; a's defeat ends it ("... was defeated. The instance ends."): home.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@100
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log b joined a
wander -100 -60 30 until stage=stagml11,control fail epoch>=@500
log b home
